#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:245
msgid "Off by default for safety: administrators never get a persistent session, so a shared or stolen device cannot keep an admin logged in. Turn this on to honour the \"remember me\" checkbox for administrators too. Non-administrators are unaffected."
